      "a": "Electric Boat sells engineering and shipbuilding services and related manufactured items to the government. Engineering Services accounts for $7B, Ship Building and Repairing accounts for $4.6B, Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences (except Nanotechnology and Biotechnology) accounts for $3.4M, and additional manufacturing categories account for amounts between $2.4M and $464K."
